TestSuite 'Simple arithmetic operations'

TestCase 'Addition test - result should be 15'
    MOVE 5 TO NUM1
    MOVE 10 TO NUM2
    PERFORM CALCULATE
    EXPECT RESULT TO BE 15

TestCase 'Addition test with different values'
    MOVE 100 TO NUM1
    MOVE 200 TO NUM2
    PERFORM CALCULATE
    EXPECT RESULT TO BE 300
